    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n\ndef fits(folder, free):\n    total = 0\n    for path in Path(folder).rglob(\"*\"):\n        if path.is_file():\n            total += path.stat().st_size\n    return total, total <= free\n\nprint(fits(\"media\", 100))\nprint(fits(\"media\", 10))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n\ndef fits(folder, free):\n    total = 0\n    for path in Path(folder).rglob(\"*\"):\n        if path.is_file():\n            total += path.stat().st_size\n    return total, total <= free\n\nprint(fits(\"media\", 100))\nprint(fits(\"media\", 10))\n```"
    }
